  - topK still scores auth-refactor, parser-optimize, docs (older, more scored)
  - guards: auth-refactor STILL has open_questions (unfinished), lint-rules now in solver-annotations
  - guarded = {auth-refactor, parser-optimize, docs, lint-rules, ...}
